The data this plugin reads are the Reserve Bank of Australia's, published in
its statistical tables F1, F2, F17 and F11.1. Source: Reserve Bank of
Australia 2026. Some columns are third parties' content -- F1's BABs/NCDs
(ASX), F1's OIS (FENICS) and F11.1's A$1=USD (WM/Reuters) -- whose use needs
the third party's consent.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Reserve Bank of
Australia.
